# Canonical DSM response JSON for replay tests.
# Each fixture lives in a subdirectory named for its DSM API:
#   tests/fixtures/SYNO.API.Auth/login_v6_ok.json
#   tests/fixtures/SYNO.API.Auth/login_v6_otp_required.json
#   tests/fixtures/SYNO.Core.Package/list_ok.json
# ...etc. Capture with `respx --record` or by hand from the browser network tab.
